go ahead and I'll help Alan'?


00:48:06.316 --> 00:48:07.158
Thanks.


00:48:07.317 --> 00:48:08.022
This way.


00:48:08.585 --> 00:48:09.655
Okay, go.


00:48:11.154 --> 00:48:14.033
So, it faces south...


00:48:14.091 --> 00:48:15.331
