00:50:08.839 --> 00:50:11.410
Oh my God,
it's completely, barren.


00:50:12.175 --> 00:50:13.176
COPY-


00:50:25.989 --> 00:50:27.366
I'm setting out...


00:50:27.891 --> 00:50:28.995
