00:54:49.119 --> 00:54:50.063
No.


00:54:50.487 --> 00:54:51.693
Bruno come in, Bruno!


00:54:52.489 --> 00:54:53.729
Bruno, fuck.


00:54:54.491 --> 00:54:56.027
Okay, I'm going to go get him.


00:54:56.092 --> 00:54:56.968
Irene...


00:54:59.963 --> 00:55:00.964
