00:55:17.747 --> 00:55:18.657
Alan,


00:55:20.583 --> 00:55:21.687
Alan!


00:55:24.888 --> 00:55:27.334
I shot him in the face
and he kept on walking.


00:55:59.055 --> 00:56:00.125
Bruno'?


00:56:02.325 --> 00:56:03.463
Bruno, are you here'?


00:56:14.170 --> 00:56:15.478
