to get the door open.


00:56:25.014 --> 00:56:26.254
We need to hurry up.


00:56:26.883 --> 00:56:30.126
We have to find the Prototype
and get the hell out of here.


00:56:30.553 --> 00:56:31.930
Sure thing.


00:56:34.424 --> 00:56:35.869
