and his radio is not working.


00:56:42.198 --> 00:56:43.973
Okay, this guy is not alone;


00:56:46.569 --> 00:56:50.073
I'll go find them.
Stick together, okay?


00:56:53.343 --> 00:56:54.287
Let's go.


00:57:08.124 --> 00:57:11.162
Irina, finish this up,
I'm going outside to set it up.


00:57:11.594 --> 00:57:13.699
Okay, check the parameters.


00:57:14.030 --> 00:57:14.906
