00:57:15.165 --> 00:57:16.143
Sounds good.


00:58:20.196 --> 00:58:21.300
Bruno!


00:58:22.832 --> 00:58:24.175
Bruno, can you hear me'?


00:58:26.002 --> 00:58:27.003
Bruno!


00:58:32.842 --> 00:58:34.014
