00:58:49.125 --> 00:58:51.731
Outside explosives activated.


00:58:51.995 --> 00:58:53.531
I'm going back in.


00:58:53.963 --> 00:58:57.001
I repeat, I'm going back in.


00:59:06.609 --> 00:59:09.852
