01:02:23.172 --> 01:02:24.947
You're going to take me
to those documents.


01:02:25.007 --> 01:02:26.145
Right now!


01:02:27.043 --> 01:02:31.924
- They are friends,
- These people are my friends.


01:02:33.216 --> 01:02:35.492
