01:24:29.597 --> 01:24:30.507
Goddamn it.


01:24:31.199 --> 01:24:32.507
GO, go!


01:25:01.362 --> 01:25:03.171
Identify yourself.


01:25:04.599 --> 01:25:06.636
Zero, zero twelve.


01:25:07.202 --> 01:25:09.273
